  "abstract": "Serve DeepSeek models (V4.1-Flash, V4-Flash-0731, V4-Pro-0813, V4 previews, V3.2, R1 and distills) with the right prompt encoding, DSML tool and reasoning parsers, reasoning-effort toggles, sampling and quants. Covers vLLM, SGLang, llama.cpp, TensorRT-LLM, Ollama, MLX and TensorFold on DGX Spark, consumer RTX, Apple Silicon, Hopper and Blackwell. References are split into models, parsers and templates, platforms and quants, and known issues.",
